Ghib.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Ghib''' is an [[Astra Militarum]] [[Colonel]] in the [[188th Cadian]] [[Regiment]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
After their victory in the [[Morbid Rift Campaign]], Ghib and the [[188th Cadian]] were rewarded by being indentured to a [[Rogue Trader House]]. This House then ventured into the [[Koronus Expanse]] and the [[Regiment]] cut a swathe through regions of space no [[Human]] had ever visited. Among the things they encountered there, were the remains of ancient [[Xenos]] civilizations and the whispers of dead gods on the stellar wind. The 188th Cadian would fight in the Expanse for over a decade, in their service to the Rogue Trader House, but the [[Colonel]] states his Regiment conquered everything they faced in that realm.{{Fn|1}}  

