Ghordane.wikitext:
{{KhornePortal}}
{{WorldEatersPortal}}
'''Ghordane the Torturer''' was a [[World Eaters]] [[Chaos Lord]], who once commanded the fortress '''Magnavox Ultima'''.{{Fn|1}}

This ended, however, when the [[Space Wolves]] began their [[Great Hunt]] known as [[Operation Stormfrost]]. Ghordane was among the foes the [[Chapter]] fought in their campaign and the [[Space Wolves]] invaded his fortress in what became a legendary attack. The Chaos Lord's World Eaters were eventually defeated and the [[Great Company]] of the [[Wolf Lord]] [[Skaldir Ironfang]] were credited with both the destruction of Magnavox Ultima and with Ghordane's death. Ironfang later returned to [[Fenris]] with the Chaos Lord's head and placed it in the shrine of the [[Great Wolf]] [[Harek Ironhelm]].{{Fn|1}}

