Gideon (Governor).wikitext:
{{ChaosPortal}}
{{ambig|subject=[[Planetary Governor|Governor]]|disambiguation=Gideon}}
'''Gideon''' was the [[Planetary Governor|Governor]] of the planet [[Solypsis]] during the [[Sabbat Worlds Crusade]].{{Fn|1}}


==Biography==
At one point in the Crusade, [[Warmaster]] [[Macaroth]] sought to use Solypsis, a rare [[Imperial]] bastion within the [[Sabbat Worlds|Sabbat Cluster]], as a mustering ground for the operation to invade the [[Cabal system]].{{Fn|3}} However, Gideon had been acting strangely for the previous year, growing reclusive and oppressive. There were even rumours in the courts of Solypsis that Gideon had developed [[Psyker|psychic abilities]]. These were indicative that the touch of [[Chaos]] was upon Gideon and Macaroth was forced to mobilise his armies to take Solypsis, lest his entire campaign falter.{{Fn|1}}

The planet was devastated in the action, with billions dead. Gideon himself was captured by agents of the [[Order of the Pious Cross]] in the [[Battle of Mawson]]. From there, Gideon's fate is unknown; rumours state that [[Inquisitor]] [[Vilhiem]] delivered the renegade governor to [[Inquisitor Lord|Lord]] [[Thoth (Inquisitor)|Thoth]].{{Fn|2}}

