Gilden (Blood Angels).wikitext:
{{BloodAngelsPortal}}
'''Gilden''' was a [[Blood Angels]] [[Dominion (Blood Angels)|Dominion]], whose forces brought what became known as the [[Gilden's Star System]] into [[Compliance]], during the [[Great Crusade]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
It was named in his honor, but the [[Gilden's Star System|Gilden's Star]]'s population later fell to [[Heresy]] during the [[Horus Heresy]], under the influence of the [[Word Bearers]] [[Dark Apostle]] [[Zaxos]]. The first [[Imperial]]s to learn of this, was a nearby [[Blood Angels]] strike force that was led by the [[Praetor (Rank)|Archein]], [[Alcetas Castael]]. He became incensed afterwards, as it was his [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]] that had brought the Gilden Stars' worlds into [[Compliance]]. This led Castael to [[Gilden's Star Campaign|attack]] the System and he successfully cleaned the Gilden's Star of its corruption.{{Fn|1}}

