'''Giulus Icaris''' is a [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] in the [[Ultramarines]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
Before he achieved his current rank, Icaris was mentored by [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] [[Denaris]]. In [[M42]], they were among the [[Ultramarines]]' forces that fought [[Plague Marine]]s on [[Korvon 11]] and fought side by side against them. However during the course of the battle, Denaris was killed when a Plague Marine's blade pierced his hearts. This caused him to drop his [[chainsword]], which was then picked up by Icaris. Denaris' death was then avenged, when Icaris used the Sergeant's weapon to strike the Plague Marine down. In the battle's aftermath, Icaris claimed the chainsword as his own and named it [[Denaris' Vengeance]], in honour of his fallen mentor. Sometime later, he would achieve the rank of Sergeant.{{Fn|1}}

