Gizhaum Danver De Banzi Haight Gilbear.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Gizhaum Danver De Banzi Haight Gilbear''' (often shortened to '''Gizhaum Gilbear''') was a high-ranking officer of the [[Royal Volpone]] [[Imperial Guard]] [[regiment]]s that served in the [[Sabbat Worlds Crusade]].{{Fn|1a}}{{Fn|2b}}


==Biography==
The second son of the Haight Gilbears of Solenhofen on [[Volpone]] (the royal house of that world), Gilbear served as a [[Major]] in the [[Royal Volpone 50th]] and aide/senior-adjutant to [[General]] [[Noches Sturm]] at the time of the regiment's deployment on [[Voltemand]].{{Fn|1a}}

He was later in charge of a detachment from the Volpone 50th's [[Imperial Guard Veteran|elite]] Tenth Brigade assigned to escort [[Inquisitor]] [[Lilith Abfequarn]] in the course of the [[Monthax]] campaign.{{Fn|1c}}

By the time of the [[Siege of Vervunhive]], Gilbear had been promoted to the rank of [[Colonel]], again serving as one of General Sturm's senior officers as part of the Astra Militarum taskforce sent to reinforce [[Vervunhive]] against a [[Chaos]] invasion.{{Fn|2a}}{{Fn|2b}}

==Appearance==
Gilbear is nearly two and a half meters tall and described as arrogantly powerful. He has big, blunt, bland features and the languid hooded eyes of the aristocracy. He wore the grey and gold uniform of the [[Royal Volpone 50th]], also known as the 'Bluebloods'.{{Fn|1}}

