[[Image:GoetheDarkflame.jpg|thumb|right|200px|{{PAGENAME}}{{Fn|1}}]]
A member of The Pyre for centuries, he is devout to the [[Chaos Gods]], though this is eclipsed by his burning hatred of the [[Imperium]]. The only part of his personality more powerful than his hatred is his self-preservation, and he is not too proud to retreat from a situation which he believes are not in his favor. This is somewhat offset by his own opinion of his combat prowess.{{Fn|1}}

