Gor Half-Horn.wikitext:
{{NecromundaPortal}}
[[File:Gor Half-Horn.JPG|thumbnail|220px|Portrait of {{PAGENAME}}{{Fn|2}}]]
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromundan]] [[Beastman]] [[bounty hunter]] who offers his service in [[Hive Primus]]. No one knows where the mysterious Gor came from or how a [[Mutant]] was able to attain a bounty hunter license.{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
Being a beastman, Gor is a figure of dread in the [[underhive]], but this fact also makes him just as equally the target for every raving zealot he encounters. As a sanctioned bounty hunter, Gor is entitled, in theory at least, to go wherever he will in pursuit of his targets; in reality, he has often found himself the quarry, though so far none have bested him.{{Fn|4}}

Because it is so rare for a Beastman to be sanctioned as a bounty hunter, Gor has become the subject of numerous legends throughout the underhive. Some say he was once a member of an [[Abhuman]] Auxilia attached to an [[Astra Militarum]] [[regiment]], and the sole survivor of a battle of apocalyptic proportions. Others whisper that he was once in the employ of an [[Inquisitor]], whose service he fled for a life among the damned. Some have even claimed that he was not born an Abhuman at all, but a noble scion who developed hideous mutations in his adolescence and fled downhive lest he be put to death by his own kin.{{Fn|2}}{{Fn|3b}}

He has been seen fighting alongside the [[Sump Dogs]] [[gang]] of [[House Orlock]].{{Fn|3a}}

