Goremann's favoured Dreadnought armour is the war machine called '''Furiousa Rex''' with its twin [[power fist]]s and underslung [[flamer]]s. In battle, Goremann's devastating charge can level a horde of lesser foes, crushing them beneath a terrifying avalanche of [[adamantium]] fists and steel limbs. Thankfully, such heavyweight support is seldom required in the field and Goremann's experience more often serves the Deathwatch in tactical analyses and threat assessments. This vexes him greatly and he will seize on any opportunity to see action again.{{Fn|1}}

