Gorny.wikitext:
'''Gorny''' was a [[Loyalist]] pilot of the [[Chaos]] insurrectionist Governor [[Narbo]] of [[Sepus Prime]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
During the [[Chaos]] insurrection of [[Sepus Prime]], Gorny infiltrated Governor [[Narbo]]'s inner circle on [[Imperial Guard]] Lieutenant [[Sorov]]'s orders.{{Fn|1}}

When the Imperial Guard pushed to take the civitate, they were pinned down by insurrectionist forces at [[Tadmor Ridge]]. Governor [[Narbo]] set off for Tadmor Ridge in his personal [[Aquila Lander]], and Gorny sent the exact route the Lander would take to Sorov.{{Fn|1}}

Due to Gorny's information, Sorov's unit were able to down Narbo's Lander, and kill the Governor even after he transformed into a [[Chaos Spawn]]. Despite this, the planet was [[Virus Bomb]]ed, killing everyone except [[Sanctioned Psyker]] [[Glutt]].{{Fn|1}}

==Trivia==
{{Trivia}}
