Graeves.wikitext:
{{ImperialNavyPortal}}
'''Graeves''' is an [[Imperial Navy]] [[Vice Admiral|Vice-Admiral]], who is serving in the [[Indomitus Crusade]]'s [[Battle Group Faustus (Fleet Secundus)|Battle Group Faustus]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
The [[Battle Group Faustus (Fleet Secundus)|Battle Group]] is currently taking part in the [[Thranx Purge]], against the forces of [[Chaos]], within the [[Bosphori System]]. During the campaign, '''Task Force Faustus III''' requested additional reinforcements against their foes. However before a decision was made, the Battle Group was made aware of a dire Chaos threat that the [[Rogue Psyker]] [[Darian Pellor]] had awakened. After hearing this, the Battle Group's [[Groupmaster]], [[Elena Dhaur-Carriadh]], was advised by Graeves, the [[Minotaurs]] [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Ulrech (Captain)|Ulrech]], [[Canoness]] [[Justyne]], and '''[REDACTED]''', to not reinforce Task Force Faustus III. Instead, they recommended that '''Task Force Faustus IV''' was formed, in order to deal with Pellor's threat. Dhaur-Carriadh agreed and Justyne is now commanding the Task Force against the Rogue Psyker.{{Fn|1}} 

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[White Dwarf November 2019]], pg. 50 - ''Dawn of the Era Indomitus''

