Like his fellow 'volunteers' in the [[13th Penal Legion]] the name and background of the man now known as '''"Grease Monkey"''' are all classified. Originally a member of the [[Imperial Guard]], Grease Monkey was a highly skilled driver and mechanic, much to the chagrin of his unit's [[Tech Priest]]s. While his tinkering may have eventually put him in the same position he finds himself now, it was his decision to take a [[grav-vehicle]] belonging to the ambassador of the [[Iyanden]] [[Craftworld]] that landed him on the [[penal colony]] [[Devlan 5]].{{Fn|1}}

Grease Monkey's talent with vehicles serves him well in the 'Last Chancers'. Capable of driving virtually any vehicle known to humankind as well as hot-wiring and repairing them, he is able to get the team out of many a sticky situation in a hurry. When not behind the wheel Grease Monkey is armed with a [[bolt pistol]].{{Fn|1}}

