'''Gregor Dessian''' is the current [[Chapter Master]] of the [[Imperial Fists]], having taken command after his predecessor, [[Vorn Hagan]], died defending [[Terra]] in the aftermath of the [[Great Rift|Great Rift's]] creation.{{Fn|1}}

