Grell.wikitext:
{{TanithPortal}}
{{otheruses|USE=[[Sergeant (Imperial Guard)|Sergeant]]|OTHERUSE=Xenos species|OTHERPAGE=Grell (Xenos Species)}}
'''Grell''' was a [[Sergeant (Imperial Guard)|Sergeant]] of the [[Tanith First and Only]].{{Fn|1a}}


==Biography==
Back home on [[Tanith]], Grell had experience as an engineer before enlisting for the planet's first Founding of [[Imperial Guard Regiment]]s.{{Fn|1b}} He achieved the rank of Sergeant, serving in the regiment's fifth [[platoon]].{{Fn|1a}}

When the Tanith First were deployed against the [[Shriven (Chaos Cult)|Shriven]] on the [[Forge World]] of [[Fortis Binary]], Grell was amongst those Tanith Guardsmen under [[Colonel]] [[Colm Corbec|Corbec]] who were pinned behind enemy lines, isolated from [[Colonel-Commissar]] [[Ibram Gaunt|Gaunt]] (the regiment's commanding officer) by an artillery bombardment.{{Fn|1a}}

Later in the assault on the Shriven's lines, Corbec and his men linked back up with Gaunt, the rest of the Tanith and a detachment of [[Vitrian Dragoons]] led by Colonel [[Zoren]]. Together, the Guard infiltrated one of the Shriven's munitions dumps.{{Fn|1b}}{{Fn|1c}} There, they engaged the cultists and a number of [[Iron Warriors]] [[Chaos Space Marine]]s. Grell was killed by a [[bolt]] round.{{Fn|1c}}

