Grennon.wikitext:
{{DeathwatchPortal}}
'''Grennon''' was a [[Space Marines|Space Marine]] of the [[Deathwatch]].{{Fn|1}}

Grennon was one of the Deathwatch Marines aboard the [[Strike Cruiser]] ''[[Incontrovertible Truth]]'' when it was ambushed by ships of the [[Black Legion]]. As the [[Chaos Space Marine]]s crippled and boarded the vessel, Grennon was one of a group of Marines who were prevented from joining [[Watch Captain]] [[Gharvil]] in repelling the boarders by damage to the ship. Instead, Grennon and the Marines with him attempted to set ambushes of their own in order to bring down the invaders.{{Fn|1}}

Although the Deathwatch Marines were able to kill a number of Chaos Marines, Grennon was the first of the ad-hoc group to die, after being run through by a Black Legionnaire with [[Lightning Claw]]s.{{Fn|1}}

==Notes==
*Grennon's [[Chapter]] of origin is never explicitly stated. His Chapter's symbol is stated to be ''"the silhouette of a grasping claw, picked out by orange flames"'', possibly indicating that he is a member of the [[Fire Claws]].{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
