Grevan.wikitext:
{{ImperialKnightsPortal}}
[[Image:Grevan.jpg|thumb|right|{{PAGENAME}}'s [[Knight]], the ''Ferrous Maximus'']]
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Knight]] and leader of [[House Raven]]. Lord Grevan Raven, fourth of his name, is the Princeps of House Raven, the Iron Duke of Kolossi and he who sits upon the Adamantium Throne of the Keep Inviolate. A single white stripe on his Knight suit, Ferrous Maximus, denotes him as Princeps. As a young pilot he joined the Order of Companions – the fighting elite of the house – where all noted his martial prowess. His meteoric rise continued to the highest level, as befitted his noble ancestry.{{Fn|1}}

Despite the many Knight suits available to House Raven, the majority of them are Errant and Paladin patterns. ''Ferrous Maximus'', however, is a [[Knight Warden]]. As the legend goes, its avenger gatling cannon was triply blessed by the Omnissiah himself. Whenever the Knight’s need is greatest, the pilot of Ferrous Maximus can recall that ancient stored memory, bringing forth a rapid burst of fire that is impossibly accurate, shredding even the largest foe.{{Fn|1}}

