Grigor Karollus.wikitext:
{{ChaosKnightsPortal}}
'''Grigor Karollus''' is a [[Dreadblade]], who pilots the crimson [[Knight Abominant]] ''Thres'tal'agor''.{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He is the leader of the [[Triumvirate of Torment]], which is also composed of the [[Dreadblade]]s [[Talon of Ruin]] and [[Nicodemus]]. However Karollus is fused within the ''Thres'tal'agor'''s [[Throne Mechanicum]], as his flesh has stretched and melded to its machinery with unpleasant growths. His [[psychic]] might, though, is fed by three captured [[Psykers]], who hang impaled upon rusted spikes on the Thres'tal'agor's cursed rune covered carapace. Even as they are tormented by the [[Knight Abominant]]'s [[Pterrorshade]]s, the Psykers' essence is taken by Karollus, who lets it wind around his [[Electroscourge]] and soak into Thres'tal'agor's fabric. His powers have caused the Knight Abominant to develop a mantle of shadow around it, which is filled with [[Warp|eldritch energies]].{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
