Griselda Velade.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Griselda Velade''' was a [[Trooper]] of the [[Valhallan Ice Warriors]].{{Fn|1}}

Originally a member of the [[Valhallan 296th]] [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiment]], she became a member of the [[Valhallan 597th]] when the 296th was amalgamated with another regiment (the [[Valhallan 301st|301st]]) following losses taken defending the planet [[Corania]] from the [[tyranid]]s.{{Fn|1}}

Shortly after the regiments were joined, while on board the troop ship ''[[Righteous Wrath]]'' en route to their first deployment on [[Gravalax]], several Guardsmen from the 296th and 301st became involved in a violent mess room brawl.  Velade was one of five to be singled out for severe punishment, in her case for killing another Trooper during the fight.  The five were court-marshalled and were going to be sentenced to execution by the ''Righteous Wrath's'' [[Imperial Navy Captain|Captain]], [[Parjita]].  However, he was convinced to turn over sentencing to the regiment's [[Commissar]], [[Ciaphas Cain]].  Cain, in turn, deferred the guards' executions and decided to transfer them to a [[penal legion]] at the next available opportunity.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[For the Emperor (Novel)]] - [[Ciaphas Cain: Hero of the Imperium (Omnibus)]], Chapter Two

