Grogan.wikitext:
{{TanithPortal}}
'''Grogan''' was a [[Trooper]] of the [[Tanith First and Only]].{{Fn|1}}


==Biography==
Grogan served from the [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiment's]] inception on [[Tanith]]. In the Tanith First's third theatre, [[Caligula (Hive World)|Caligula]], the [[troop-ship]] Grogan was riding in was brought down by a [[Psyker|psychic storm]] in the forest caldera [[K7-75]]. Grogan suffered a broken arm in the crash and a number of others were badly wounded. [[Major]] [[Elim Rawne|Rawne]] advocated leaving the wounded behind or mercy-killing them. However [[Colonel-Commissar]] [[Ibram Gaunt|Gaunt]], the regiment's commander, chose to take Grogan and the others with them. Sure enough, thanks to Gaunt's leadership, all of the survivors of the crash made it off Caligula in one piece, despite a fight against a number of [[Chaos Cult]]ists.{{Fn|1}}

