Gruis.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Veteran Guardsman|Veteran]] [[Imperial Guard Sergeant]] in the [[Cadian 119th Rifles]] [[Imperial Guard Regiment|Regiment]] and served as part of the '''VIth Demolition Engineers'''.{{Fn|1}}

During the Cadian 119th Rifles' battle against [[Ork]]s on [[Flakgor IX]], a [[Stompa]] appeared which threatened to overwhelmed the Regiment. Seeing that its force field prevented the war machine from being damaged, {{PAGENAME}} gave his soul to the [[Emperor of Mankind|Emperor]] and led a charge against the Stompa, with [[Guardsmen]] [[Ptes Stanlin]] and [[Datery]], while armed with [[demolition charge]]s. Braving the Orks fire, the three reached the Stompa and planted their demolition charges on its feet, before detonating the explosives. Though they were all killed in the subsequent blast, their sacrifice critically damaged the Stompa and stopped its advance; which allowed the Cadian 119th Rifles, to force the Orks to retreat. Afterwards, their [[Colonel]], [[Darius (Colonel)|Darius]], contacted the '''Officio Virtus''' and recommended that for their heroic actions, {{PAGENAME}} should receive the '''Silver Aquilla''', while Ptes and Datery should each receive the '''Bronze Aquilla'''.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [http://warhammerworld.games-workshop.com/2014/04/30/event-review-battle-brothers-april-2014/g-i-jokes-and-the-sacrifice-at-flakgor-ix/ Warhammer World - G.I. Jokes and the Sacrifice at Flakgor IX]

