Grunal Krom.wikitext:
{{CollegiaTitanicaPortal}}
'''Grunal Krom'''  was the [[Collegia Titanica Grand Master|Grand Master]] of [[Legio Crucius]], during the [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}} 

He took part in the [[Defence of Ryza]] and lamented that the [[Horus Heresy|new age]] the Legio's forebears had long feared, was now upon them. Krom then told his [[Princeps]], that they must discard their hope and idealism, born of the [[Great Crusade]], and instead embrace their wrath and sense of justice. The [[Collegia Titanica Grand Master|Grand Master]] claimed the [[Galaxy]] was now plagued by [[Traitor]]s, and that [[Legio Crucius]] would be the fire that scoured it clean of disease.{{Fn|1}}

