Guardatus.wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
'''Guardatus''' is a [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] in the [[Ultramarines]] [[Chapter]]'s [[2nd Company (Ultramarines)|2nd Company]].{{Fn|1b}}
==History==
He was among its forces{{Fn|1a}} that took part in the [[First Tyrannic War]]'s [[Battle for Macragge]], where the [[Ultramarines]] defended their [[Adeptus Astartes Homeworld|Homeworld]] from [[Hive Fleet Behemoth]].{{Fn|1}} The [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]]'s squadron later aided the [[Chapter]] in achieving a major victory, when the [[Hive Fleet]]'s [[Bioship]]s were destroyed in [[Macragge]]'s orbit. However the battle on its surface continued to rage and the Ultramarines' [[Chapter Master]], [[Calgar]], ordered the Chapter's forces in orbit to deploy to Macragge. Squad Guardatus was among those that did so and they were given the mission of holding the line against the [[Xenos]] at all costs.{{Fn|1a}} 

As the battle continued to rage, the squadron later aided the [[Space Marine Dreadnought|Dreadnought]] [[Ferrox (Dreadnought)|Ferrox]] in defending a small [[2nd Company (Ultramarines)|2nd Company]] outpost. As they did so, though, the [[Tyranids]] overran the outpost's outer defenses and advanced upon them.{{Fn|1b}} Squad Guardatus survived that battle and then aided their [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]], [[Agemman]], in defending one of Macragge's sectors. They eventually needed more reinforcements to do so and Squad Guardatus protected Agemman, as the Captain activated a [[Locator Beacon]] in order to summon more Ultramarines to his side.{{Fn|1c}} This was successful and Guardatus and his squadron continued to aid Agemman in protecting their assigned sector.{{Fn|1d}}

