Gunther.wikitext:
{{ImperialFistsPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a member of the [[Imperial Fists]] 64th Squad, [[344th Company (Imperial Fists Legion)|344th Company]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
[[Image:Gunther.jpg|thumb|right|200px|{{PAGENAME}}{{Fn|1}}]]
Gunther was a [[Space Marine Veteran|Legion Veteran]], having served on [[Terra]] in the [[Unification War]] prior to the [[Great Crusade]].{{Fn|1}}

During the Crusade, Gunther earned the [[Space Marine Honours|Veteran's Cross]]. He was a survivor of the [[War of the Howling Gyre]]; as a result he was entitled to colour portions of his [[power armour]] black.{{Fn|1}}

The 64th squad was recalled when [[Horus]] [[Horus Heresy|betrayed]] the [[Imperium]] and was sent to serve on the ''[[Oath of Stone]]''. When the [[Iron Warriors]] [[Battle of Phall|attacked]] the Imperial Fists, Gunther and his squad performed a void assault against the [[grand cruiser]] ''[[Atropos]]'', using their [[jump pack]]s to propel across the void as the vessel closed. Within minutes of the assault the ''Oath of Stone'' was destroyed though and any members of the 64th squad that survived the explosion were cast into the void. Nothing more is known of the fate of Gunther, thousands of his brothers, or the ''Atropos''.{{Fn|1}}

