Gunther Radrexxus.wikitext:
{{ImperialNavyPortal}}{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Gunther Radrexxus''' is a vaunted and pompous [[Lord Admiral]], who commands the [[Rogue Trader House]] [[House Radrexxus|Radrexxus]], which is part of the [[Davamir Compact]] [[Rogue Trader]] alliance.{{Fn|1a}} 

==History==
He wears a powdered periwig and is extravagantly dressed, unlike his somber major-domo [[Maximillian]]. Gunther is also well known for his love of [[Narcotics]], leaving the [[Davamir Compact|Compact]]'s members to wonder how many he is under the influence of, when they see him.{{Fn|1a}}

As Radrexxus and his fleet travel towards [[Endymica]] with the rest of the Compact, it is eventually revealed that he was a [[Genestealer Cult]]ist of the [[Cult of the Starborne Sons]] and had orchestrated the murder of his liege, [[Davos Lamertine]].{{Fn|1b}} Davos' son [[Erastus Lamertine|Erastus]] is able to fight back the Radrexxus Genestealer Cultists just as the forces of [[Delvetar Astraneus]] arrive and help the loyalists escape into the [[Great Rift]].{{Fn|1c}}

Gunther was originally thought dead in the final battle, but is revealed to have survived the encounter with Erastus and has crowned himself the Void King of the [[Umbral Crown]].{{Fn|1d}}

