Gurrian.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Gurrian''' was a [[Captain (Imperial Guard)|Captain]] of the [[13th Valstadt Armoured]], commanding the [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiment's]] 1st Reconnaissance Company in late [[M41]].{{Fn|1}}

In '''987.[[M41]]''', the 13th Valstadt Armoured were deployed on [[Lammas]] in [[Lammas Campaign|a protracted war]] against the [[Eldar]]. At 543.987.M41, Gurrian and his company were ordered by [[Colonel]] [[Kessen]] to scout ahead of the regiment's position at [[Hervat Colony]] in preparation for an advance towards the [[Karsundi River]]. As the company made their way to [[Karsundi Alpha]], they were harassed by [[Nightwing Fighter]]s, resulting in the loss of some scout vehicles.{{Fn|1}}

By 546.987, Gurrian and his men had reached Karsundi Alpha, finding it occupied by eldar ground forces - [[Guardian]]s and [[Ranger]]s deployed by [[Vampire Raider]]s. The Valstadt Reconnaissance company, along with some [[Armoured Fist]] [[platoon]]s sent ahead as reinforcements, were able to force the Eldar to retreat, but Gurrian was wounded by a sniper during the fighting. While he recovered from his injuries, his second-in-command, [[Lieutenant (Imperial Guard)|Lieutenant]] [[Talbor]], took command of the company in his stead.{{Fn|1}}

