Gustav Karlson II.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Lord General]] on [[Armageddon]] and was the '''Chief of Staff of the [[Armageddon Secundus]] Command Guard''' when the [[First War for Armageddon]] began.{{Fn|1a}}

When half of Armageddon's [[PDF]] turned to [[Heresy]], as the [[Space Hulk]] ''[[Devourer of Stars]]'' entered their planet's orbit, Gustav acted quickly and eliminated those units he could not absolutely rely on, in order to maintain control. His counterpart on [[Armageddon Prime]] was slower to react, however, and was not able to raise a proper defence before the [[Daemon Prince]] [[Angron]] and his forces invaded. As a result Armageddon Prime soon fell to Angron's forces, but the survivors of the [[Chaos]] attack were able to retreat to Armageddon Secundus, which remained a stable stronghold due to Gustav's actions.{{Fn|1a}}

Gustav would survive the war and later wrote a memoir of his experience fighting Angron's forces. After being lost for centuries, his writings were rediscovered.{{Fn|1a}} Though his memoir gave a great incite into the First War for Armageddon, it was ordered suppressed by the [[Ordo Malleus]], who had it stored in their archives.{{Fn|1b}}

