Hadeya Etsul.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
[[Image:SteelTread.jpg|thumb|right|200px|Hadeya Etsul and the crew of the [[Steel Tread (Leman Russ Demolisher)|Steel Tread]]{{Fn|1}}]]
'''Hadeya Etsul''' is the [[Tank Commander]] of the [[Cadian]] [[Leman Russ Demolisher]], [[Steel Tread (Leman Russ Demolisher)|Steel Tread]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
However she is not [[Cadian]],born on the planet [[Tsegoh]], as Etsul became the [[Steel Tread (Leman Russ Demolisher)|Steel Tread]]'s [[Tank Commander|Commander]], after being consolidated into a [[Cadian Shock Trooper]] Regiment, the Cadian Forty-Ninth Armoured.{{Fn|2}} This occurred in [[M42]], as the [[Astra Militarum]] fought against the forces of [[Chaos]] on [[Croatoas]]. As the conflict becomes increasingly desperate, Etsul is haunted by nightmares and is striving to find her place amidst the proud and insular Cadians. Their culture is vastly different from her old Regiment, but she must learn to take command of the Steel Tread's dysfunctional crew, if they hope to survive.{{Fn|1}}

