Hagar Freelord.wikitext:
{{NecromundaPortal}}
'''Hagar Freelord''' is the master of the [[Mercator Umbrus]] on [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]], a criminal counterpart to the [[Mercator Gelt]].{{Fn|1}}
==Biography==
[[File:HagarFreelord.jpg|thumb|right|250px|Hagar Freelord{{Fn|1}}]]
He was once the ruler of [[Port Mad Dog]]. He was exiled from the [[Merchant Guild]] by his own children during the Night of Bullets. As [[Ash Wastes Nomad]] tribes attacked, his two sons and three daughters conspired to send him and his loyal followers into the wastes. Upon returning, Hagar found himself framed for the raid and accused of failing to pay the Imperial House.{{Fn|1}}

Cast out, Hagar has since sought revenge and his former position. He formed the [[Mercator Umbrus]], dealing in the [[underhive]]'s illicit economies. This exile has made him leaner, meaner, and a deadly shot with [[plasma pistol]]s. His followers, benefiting from his wealth and connections, are well-armed and equipped beyond typical [[Outcast (Necromunda)|outcast]] standards.{{Fn|1}}

