Hagthor Jarlun.wikitext:
{{NecromundaPortal}}
[[file:HagthorJarlun.jpg|thumb|right|220px|Hagthor Jarlun{{Fn|1}}]]
'''Hagthor Jarlun''' is one of the few [[Jardlan]] [[Ironhead Squat Prospector]]s still alive and he has also formed an infamous [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]] [[Abyssal Ferrymen]] team with his partner, [[Aster Felsturn]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
After surviving [[Jardlan]]'s destruction, Jarlun made many expeditions into the forbidden ruins of [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]]'s [[Hive Secundus]]. It was during one such venture, that the [[Ironhead Squat Prospector]] witnessed [[Aster Felsturn]] fight off a dozen [[Malstrain Genestealer|Malstrain]] [[Brood Scum]]. After Felsturn emerged victorious, using nothing but a [[jack wrench]] and a desire to survive, Jarlun followed her back to the teeming [[abyssal ferrymen]] settlement of [[Port Styx]]. Seeing an opportunity to make a living, the Ironhead convinced Felsturn to work with him as a team of ferrymen and their skills and temperaments have gone on to complement each other. Felsturn is a source of endless innovation and she constantly modifies their equipment, which Jarlun keeps working no matter how outlandish her changes are. Also, though she is willing to take riskier contracts into Hive Secundus, the more cautious Ironhead makes sure it is nothing the infamous pair can not handle.{{Fn|1}}

