Hale'drithea.wikitext:
{{EldarPortal}}
'''Lady Hale'drithea''' is the [[Corsair Princess]] of the [[Black Suns]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
She believes the stars belonged to the ancient  [[Aeldari]] and thus belong to her as well. Hale'drithea claims this allows her to go where she wants, take what she needs and kill who she wills, as a [[Corsair Princess]]. The void represents wealth and freedom to her, compared to the tightly bound chords of the [[Eldar Path]], which she has rejected. This is also why Hale'drithea has disavowed the pettiness of [[Commorrite]] politics, the plain frugality of the [[Exodite]]s, the masks of the clownish [[Harlequins]] and the [[Ynnead|death worshiping]] [[Ynnari]].{{Fn|1}} 

