Hamanet.wikitext:
{{NecronsPortal}}
[[Image:HamanetArt.jpg|thumb|right|220px|{{PAGENAME}}{{Fn|1}}]]
'''Hamanet the Restless''' is a powerful [[Cryptek]] of the [[Tsarakura Dynasty]].{{Fn|1}}

===History===
Before [[Biotransference]], Hamanet hated how warriors were casually thrown to their deaths by their Overlords. This was not out of empathy, but rather viewing it as a simple waste of resources. He thus spent much of his mortal life dedicated to developing technology to restore wounded soldiers to the front. When the [[C'tan]] introduced biotransference, Hamanet enthusiastically accepted it and has since studied how to modify the [[Living Metal]] of the Necrons to even more effectively regenerate wounds.{{Fn|1}}

Currently, Hamanet seeks the device of his own design known as the [[Arks of Hamanet]]. This is vital to maintaing his dynasty's control over their [[Necron Overlord|Overlords]], and to that end has journeyed to the ''[[Gallowdark]]''.{{Fn|3}}

Hamanet is served by his faithful [[Despotek]] [[Thotep|Thotep of the Eternal Gaze]], who was once a street urchin that his master plucked from the underbelly of [[Necrontyr]] society.{{Fn|1}}

===Sources===
*{{Endn|1}}: [[Kill Team: Shadowvaults]], pgs. 24-25
