Hans Kho'ren.wikitext:
{{WorldEatersPortal}}
'''Hans Kho'ren''',{{Fn|1}} nicknamed "The Skull-Taker",{{Fn|2}} is a [[World Eaters]] [[Chaos Lord]] and leader of the [[Skull Takers of Hans Kho'ren]].{{Fn|1}}

In the [[Great Scouring]], Kho'ren was the "war-leader" of the World Eaters [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]]'s [[19th Company (World Eaters)|19th Company]]. In the period before the [[Battle of Skalathrax]], he served as part of the Legion's "Enclave" leadership council. At the time, he was one of the most sane and level-headed officers of the World Eaters.{{Fn|2}}

Thousands of years after the [[Skalathrax]] campaign, Kho'ren led his warband at the side of [[Angron]] in the [[First War for Armageddon]].{{Fn|1}}

