Haphax Mitranda.wikitext:
{{AdeptusMechanicusPortal}}
[[Secutor]] '''Haphax Mitranda''' is a [[Skitarii]] commander from the [[Forge World]] of [[Hephaesto]], who became the Field Commander for the [[Forge World]]'s Primary Forge, '''Node Primus''', when it was invaded by [[Orks]].{{Fn|1a}}

==History==
However while they attempted to lead [[Hephaesto]]'s forces against the [[Orks]] of the [[Tekwaaagh!]] and the [[Freebooter]] [[Badrukk]], they could not fight as they wished. This was because the [[Forge World]]'s commanding [[Tech-Priest Dominus]] [[Ronrul Illutar]], arrogantly thought of the Orks as nothing but tool wielding animals. This led the Dominus to underestimate the [[Xenos]] and when the Orks did not attack his pre-arranged ambush locations, Illutar refused to alter his battle-plans{{Fn|1b}}. The Dominus was convinced his strategy would work and repeatedly counter-manned Mitranda's orders when they attempted to bypass it. This prevented the Secutor from ordering the idle ambush forces to areas where the Orks were actually attacking '''Node Primus'''' defenses. Because of Illutar's ineptness, the Forge's outer walls were breached by the Orks and Mitranda was forced to order a retreat further within Node Primus.{{Fn|1a}}

==Notes==
Mitranda is Non-binary gender and refers to themselves as they or by using their name.{{Fn|1a}}

