The '''Harbinger''' is a [[Rogue Psyker]]-turned prophet on the [[Imperial]] [[Industrial World]] [[Garranox]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
In [[M42]], he appeared at a recently discovered [[Necron Tomb World|tomb complex]] of [[Blackstone|night-black stone]], that works crews had been sent to. They had begun experiencing nightmares and portents of death soon afterwards, which were spurred on by the Harbinger's doomsaying. Local [[Celestian Insidiant]] [[Battle Sisters]] of the [[Adeptus Sororitas]] [[Order of Our Martyred Lady]] were then sent to bring down the dangerous [[Heretic]]. But [[Black Legion]] [[Murderwing]]s who had been charged with disrupting the [[Realm of Ultramar]] learned of this and are now attacking the Celestians at the tomb complex.{{Fn|1}}  

