[[Image:Hasmoteph.jpg|thumb|right|200px|{{PAGENAME}}{{Fn|2}}]]
'''Hasmoteph''' is a [[Necron]] [[Phaeron]].{{Fn|1}}


===Biography===
His list of titles grows longer with every conquest he completes. Among them are the '''Master of the Thousand Worlds''', '''Oppressor of the Vordish Hordes''', '''Grand Immolator of the Poisoned Star''', '''He who fought the Screaming God''', '''Wielder of the Song of Sorrows''', '''Master of the Seven Realities''', '''Lord of the Outer Kingdoms''', '''Executioner of Cossol''' and '''Wearer of the Starpyre Raiment'''.{{Fn|1}}

During a battle, his [[Royal Warden]], [[Mohep|Mohep the Indomitable]], acts as Hasmoteph's herald and proclaims the Phaeron's titles to his foes. Tradition dictates that, should Hasmoteph not be victorious by the time Mohep finished his recitation, then the Phaeron would be compelled to join the battle. On such occasions, Hasmoteph has doled out severe punishments to his [[Dynasty]], in order to show his disappointment. Another occurrence seems to be happening soon, as Hasmoteph's forces are currently struggling to defeat blue-armoured [[Space Marines]]. Privately, however, the Phaeron is willing his Royal Warden to finish proclaiming his titles, as it has been an age since Hasmoteph has gotten to butcher the lesser races in person.{{Fn|1}} 

