Heda.wikitext:
{{AdeptaSororitasPortal}}
'''Heda''' is a [[Sister Dialogus]] of the [[Adepta Sororitas]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
[[Image:Heda.jpg|thumb|right|200px|{{PAGENAME}}{{Fn|1}}]]
In [[M42]], she was part of an [[Imperial]] fleet, that was sent to end a [[Chaos]] rebellion on the vital [[Mining World]] [[Siscia]]. Heda was among the [[Adepta Sororitas|Sororitas]] that were under the command of [[Canoness Preceptor]] [[Oris]], who had command of the [[Retribution Class Battleship]] [[Fiery Heart (Battleship)|Fiery Heart]]. The Battleship was sent by the fleet to Siscia as its vanguard. Oris' forces would then aid in invading the world, when the rest of the fleet arrived there. However as the Canoness' forces prepared themselves, Oris was approached by the [[Ordo Hereticus]] [[Inquisitor]] [[Ander]], who sought her assistance. Before the rebellion had begun, Ander had sent one of his [[Acolyte]]s to Siscia, in search of a powerful object and to discover who led the Cult. This was before it became such a dire threat and Ander had lost contact with his Acolyte since the uprising began. He asked Oris to secretly send a effiecnt force of Sororitas to find his Acolyte, before the fleet began its invasion. He also requested that a [[Sister Dialogus]] be among the Sororitas sent, as well. Oris agreed and sent a force of 8 Sororitas to Siscia, who were led by [[Canoness]] [[Veridyan]]. Heda was chosen as the Sister Dialogus, who would accompany them to the besieged world.{{Fn|1}}

