Hedara Pashet.wikitext:
{{ThousandSonsPortal}}
'''Hedara Pashet''' is a [[Thousand Sons]] [[Sorcerer]], who commands a [[Warpcoven]] known as the [[Coils Infernum]], which is among its forces that invaded [[Harlecrypt Tertius]], during the [[Prosperan Rift War]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
The [[Coils Infernum]] relishes causing death and destruction for its own sake. Pashet feels this way as well and enjoys close combat, where he can rip out throats with his avian talons or smash his horned helmet into heads. According to information gathered by [[Interrogator]]-[[Lieutenant (Imperial Guard)|Lieutenant]] [[Idon Throom]], Pashet can also manipulate time itself. As he chants praises to [[Tzeentch]] and preaches his own superiority to his foes, Pashet will slow time down or speed it up to give himself an edge in combat. He is more than a murdering monster, however, as Pashet has an immensely tactical mind. Combined with his [[Warp]] powers, he can weave his different forces together perfectly in his strategies and also aid them by increasing their fighting abilities.{{Fn|1}}

