'''Heinrich Bale''' is a [[Chaos]] [[Warmaster]].  Known to be a former disciple of the [[Gareox Prerogative|Young School]] before turning to [[Chaos]], it is believed that Bale sought to combine the hard-hitting lances of the [[Desolator Class Battleship]] with the versatility provided by [[attack craft]], ultimately resulting in the [[Desecrator Class Battleship]].  It is unknown how Bale managed these extensive modifications, but his flagship, ''The Treacherous'', proved to be a menacing foe during the [[Gothic War]].{{Fn|1}}

