'''Helicta Chemin''' is an [[Astropath]], who serves the [[Imperial Fists]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}
===Biography===
In [[M42]], she was part of the [[Chapter]]'s strike force that went to aid the [[Defenders Obscurus]]. The [[Imperial Fists]] [[Successor Chapter]]'s [[Adeptus Astartes Homeworld|Homeworld]] had been invaded by [[Hive Fleet Ouroboris]], which had devastated the Defenders. Their ruined state left Chemin with little hope that the [[Chapter]] could be rescued, even with the strike force's aid. She was initially proven correct, when after hours of fighting the outnumbered Imperial Fists fleet was unable to cut through the [[Tyranids]]' [[Bio-ship]]s. However the tide turned, when a [[Torchbearer Fleet]], sent to give the Defenders the ability to create [[Primaris Space Marines]], suddenly appeared and cut through the [[Hive Fleet]]. The Torchbearer Fleet then sent its forces to the Defenders' [[Fortress Monastery]], which was being defended by the few remaining members of the Chapter. These reinforcements secured the Fortress and Hive Fleet Ouroboris, was later defeated by the Imperial Fists and Torchbearers.{{Fn|1}}

