Hengis Blackhand.wikitext:
{{SpaceWolvesPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a senior [[Iron Priest]] of the [[Space Wolves]].  He was the senior Priest in charge of the [[Iron Isles]], on the day when a thousand [[Kraken (Sea Creature)|kraken]]s boiled out of the ocean and attacked the Wolves' stronghold.  Knowing they were vastly outnumbered by the monsters, Blackhand reluctantly ordered the gates sealed, trapping hundreds of men on the slopes of the mountains.{{Fn|1}}

