Herrahdura Zitadan.wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinePortal}}
'''Herrahdura Zitadan''' is the first and current [[Primaris Space Marine|Primaris]] [[Reclusiarch]] of the [[Dark Krakens]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
Like most experienced members of the [[Dark Krakens]], Zitadan once served as a [[Greyshield]] in the [[Indomitus Crusade]], before the [[Chapter]] was created.{{Fn|1b}} However, this has made his role harder than others who share the same role in pre-[[Ultima Founding]] Chapters. As Greyshields, the initial members of the Dark Krakens served with numerous [[Space Marines]] born from other [[Primarch]]s' [[Gene-seed]] and they had no Chapter traditions to draw strength from. It was important for Zitadan and [[Master of Sanctity]] [[Sukerno]] to change this, and their solution was to embrace the hunting cultures of the Chapter's [[Adeptus Astartes Homeworld|Homeworld]], [[Naktis]]. In doing so, the Dark Krakens have forged an identity that has finally unified its disconnected [[Battle Brothers]]. Sukerno and Zitadan also knew that in time, the Greyshield members of the Chapter would be replaced by the warriors of Naktis. So to them, it would naturally follow that their Homeworld's cultures would influence the Dark Krakens.{{Fn|1}}   

Currently, Zitadan is serving with [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Krijeni Luceior]]'s forces, which are fighting to save the [[Bianzeer's Hollow System]] from [[Hive Fleet Leviathan]].{{Fn|1}} 

==Wargear==
In battle, he wields the ''[[Hadosmite]]''.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[White Dwarf 466]], pgs. 26-27 — ''Flashpoint: Blood And Snow''

