'''Hesther Jerrodene''' is a [[Baron|Grand Duchess]] in the [[Imperial Knight]] [[Knight House|House]], [[House Jerrod|Jerrod]] and is the [[Herald (Knight)|Herald-Magnus]] of its [[Exalted Court]].{{Fn|1}}

She is leading a lance, which is fighting besides a [[Astra Militarum]] [[General]]'s [[Guardsmen]]. However, the laggard Guardsman were unable to keep up with the lance, which led to a confrontation between Jerrodene and the General. When it was suggested they wait for the Guardsmen, the Herald-Magnus refused. Jerrodene stated that [[House Jerrod]] were the greatest warriors in the [[Sub-sector]] they were fighting in and her lance consisted of the House's best Knights. She then listed some of the lance's personal accomplishments, such as the [[Marchioness]] [[Zheena]] holding [[Fulgurite Bastion]] alone, against the [[Red Templar]]. Another was [[Baron]] [[Lastair]]'s fifty-three engine kills in the [[Shanxa Campaign]]. The Herald-Magnus continued, by saying that even Vallen, who she considered to be the least of her [[Bondsman]], had taken the skulls of three traitor warlords in the last cycle. It was because of her lance's superior skills, that Jerrodene refused to wait for the General's Guardsmen.{{Fn|1}}

