Hetin Gultan.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Hetin Gultan''' was a [[Imperial Guard Sergeant|Sergeant]] in the [[Imperial Army]]'s [[Royal Zanzibari Hort]] [[Regiment]], which took part in the [[Horus Heresy]]'s [[Siege of Terra]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He and the [[Royal Zanzibari Hort]] would be among the [[Imperial]] forces that were outside of the [[Imperial Palace]]'s [[Eternity Gate (Imperial)|Eternity Gate]], when it was closed near the end of the [[Siege of Terra|Siege]]. They then faced the unending hordes of [[Warmaster]] [[Horus]], while defending the [[Inner Palace]] and the Hort forces that Gultan commanded were later killed in battle. The [[Imperial Guard Sergeant|Sergeant]] managed to survive, however, and played dead amid the corpses of his comrades, when the [[World Eaters]] approached his position. However the [[Chaos Space Marines]] could smell his fear and the World Eaters knew the dead were no longer afraid.{{Fn|1}}   

