Hibited.wikitext:
{{NecromundaPortal}}
[[Image:King Hibited.jpg|thumb|right|200px|King hibited's wanted poster{{Fn|1}}]]
'''King Hibited''' is the [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]] [[gang]] leader of the [[Flayed Dog]]'s Western Chapter.{{Fn|1}}

==History==
He has led the [[Flayed Dog]] [[gang]] in destroying or acquiring over 15,000 [[Guilder]] credits from trade convoys passing through [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]]'s western effluvial sea. A total of 430 of the [[Hive World]]'s population have been killed by the gang, though 6 were from driver errors, and the trade routes between [[Hive Primus]] and [[Hive Monolium]] are now closed until the Flayed Dog have been dealt with. In order to rectify the situation, the [[House Ulanti|Ulanti]] [[Noble House]] and the [[House Orlock|Orlock]] [[Clan House]] have placed a [[Bounty Hunter|bounty]] on King Hibited's head. They are offering a 1,000 Guilder credits for his confirmed death, as the Houses have no interest in Hibited being brought to them alive. A further 25 percent bonus has also been offered for any of the gang leader's body parts that are turned in as well.{{Fn|1}}

