'''Hixos of Naravekhi''', also known as the slave-lord, is a [[Necron]] serving under the Overlord [[Turakhin]]. He controlled alien slaves working in the palace of his overlord, and was one of the co-conspirators to overthrow him.{{Fn|1}}

