Hjalmar Stormfist.wikitext:
{{SpaceWolvesPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Wolf Lord]] of the [[Space Wolves]]' [[13th Great Company]] who emerged from the [[Eye of Terror]] during the [[13th Black Crusade]], killed in battle with the forces of the [[Inquisition]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
Hjalmar Stormfist, like all the first of the 'Wolf Brothers' of Dekk-Tra, was one of [[Leman Russ (Primarch)|Leman Russ's]] warriors before the coming of the [[Emperor of Mankind|Allfather]] to [[Fenris]]. He was one of the handful to survive the implantation process in spite of his age and the warnings of the [[Mechanicum]], becoming the Great Company's [[Standard Bearer]].{{Fn|2}} Like the rest of the Wolf Brothers, he disappeared after chasing the [[Thousand Sons]] into the [[warp]] in the [[Battle of Prospero]].{{Fn|3}}

During the [[13th Black Crusade]], Stormfist emerged from the [[Eye of Terror]] leading a force of the 13th Great Company as their [[Wolf Lord]]. They were attacked by a [[Sisters of Battle]] strike force led by the [[Inquisitor Lord]] [[Karamazov]], who had targeted the 13th Company for wearing pieces of salvaged [[Chaos]] [[Power Armour]] and for the presence of the [[Rune Priest (Space Wolves)|Rune Priest]] [[Leif Hemligjaga]] amongst their number. In the battle that followed Stormfist fought well, but met his end when he was torn apart by a [[Penitent Engine]].{{Fn|1}}

