{{ChaosPortal}}
'''Horeth'na'xrik the Accursed''' is a [[Daemon]], who is considered a noble amongst his kind.{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
He is bound within a [[Daemon Sword]], that is currently possessed by the [[Daemon Prince]] [[Zharka'noreth]]. Prior to that, the weapon was wielded by the [[Chaos Space Marine]] [[Norestor]], who Zharka'noreth had considered to be a brother. However he sought [[Daemonhood]] and obtaining the Sword that contained Horeth'na'xrik, would greatly aid him in that quest. This led Zharka'noreth to betray and sacrifice Norestor, on [[Kholash]], in order to claim the bound noble Daemon for himself.{{Fn|1}} 

