Horgek Stornvor.wikitext:
{{ImperialFistsPortal}}
'''Horgek Stornvor''' is a [[Space Marine Lieutenant|Lieutenant]] of the [[Imperial Fists]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
He commanded its forces in [[Battle Group Kallides]], which is waging the [[Indomitus Crusade]]'s [[Pariah Crusade]]. Stornvor also commanded the [[Strike Cruiser]] ''[[Barbican of Defiance]]'', which serves as the flagship of the [[Imperial Fists]]' warships in the Battle Group.{{Fn|1}}

Stornvor was key to fortifying Imperial holdings within the [[Pariah Nexus]], creating a series of fortified bastion worlds. However, he has since gone missing alongside [[Marshal (Black Templars)|Marshal]] [[Reikert Arnulf]] after leading an offensive deep into the [[Nephilim Sector]].{{Fn|2}}

