The '''Horned Darkness''' is among a number of [[Daemons]], that some in the depths of [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]]'s [[Hive Primus]] sometimes call upon.{{Fn|1}} 

Those facing death can desperately beseech it in order to live beyond their allotted life-span, and the [[Daemon]] is able to grant that last wish for a price. Those marked by the Horned Darkness, however, will be required to conduct [[Human]] sacrifices to the Daemon in order to sustain their lives. In time, though, the powers granted by the Horned Darkness will eventually turn its victims into [[Chaos Spawns]].{{Fn|1}}

