Lord '''Horrik Canorem''' was an [[Imperial Knight]] and [[High Prince]] of [[House Canorem]], which was ruled by his father, [[High King]] [[Valorik Canorem]]. The High Prince piloted the [[Knight Valiant]] '''Blade of Gaia''' and held the titles of '''Keeper of the Gates of Loralo, Wielder of the Kaloric Flame. Bringer of Hope, Herald of the Holy Order of the Adamantine Lance, The Paladin of Koto. Slayer of the Lion of Essa, the Triumphant, the Light of Stars and the Eradicator'''.{{Fn|1}}
