Host of Masks.wikitext:
{{BlackLegionPortal}}
The '''Host of Masks''' was the name given to one of the eight individuals which made up the mysterious [[Hand of Abaddon]], an organization within the [[Black Legion]] dedicated to reconstituting the [[Anathame]].{{Fn|1a}}

Representing the 3rd of the Hand, the {{PAGENAME}} is described as slithering and capable of wearing false faces. An assassin of some repute, its exact origin was not clear. Some claimed it was a corrupted [[Imperial Assassin]] while others that it was a [[Daemon]] or even the last of a [[Xenos]] species.{{Fn|1b}}

Following the [[Battle of the Stygius Gilt]], the {{PAGENAME}} was one of the remaining Hand members that escaped their [[Blackstone Fortress]] base. In the battles aftermath it acknowledged [[Tharador Yheng]] as the new first of the Hand due to the death of [[Tenebrus]].{{Fn|1c}}

