Hrafl Skarvjelsson.wikitext:
{{SpaceWolvesPortal}}{{RedCorsairsPortal}}
'''Hrafl Skarvjelsson''' is a former member of the [[Space Wolves]] [[Chapter]], who betrayed the [[Imperium]] and joined the [[Red Corsairs]] [[Chaos Warband|Warband]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==  
He abandoned his [[Chapter]], after chafing at the ties of loyalty and duty that connected Skarvjelsson to his [[Wolf Lord]]{{Fn|1}} [[Ragnar Blackmane]]{{Fn|2}}. This had prevented him from fighting how and where he chose, but that is no longer a concern for Skarvjelsson, since he joined the [[Red Corsairs]]. He has since risen to become one of the [[Chaos Warband|Warband]]'s elite [[Huscarls (Red Corsairs)|Huscarls]] and helps to protect its commander, [[Huron Blackheart]].{{Fn|1}}

