Hrothgar Ironblade.wikitext:
{{SpaceWolvesPortal}}
{{ambig|subject=Wolf Lord|disambiguation=Hrothgar}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Wolf Lord]] in the [[Space Wolves]] [[Chapter]] in late [[M41]].{{Fn|3}}{{Fn|4}} 


==Biography==
Amongst Hrothgar's most famous deeds was his defeat of the [[heretic]] [[Arch-Hierophant]] [[Vortigern]] at the [[Battle of Sestus Proxima]], ending Vortigern's 300-year rebellion. In the process, he captured Vortigern's flagship and claimed it for the Space Wolves, renaming it the ''[[Fist of Russ]]''.{{Fn|4}} 

Hrothgar was among those who was a target of the [[Blood Claw]] [[Lukas the Trickster]]. Lukas had risked being killed by the Wolf Lord after the Blood Claw poisoned the Wolf Lord's ale with the concentrated venom of a bloat-toad, though Lukas managed to evade his wrath at the time.{{Fn|1}}

Hrothgar Ironblade would not be given another chance to seek revenge on Lukas, though, as the Wolf Lord was later killed on the world [[Qi'Ki'Ci]] by the [[Word Bearers]] [[Chaos Lord]] [[Moefranc]].{{Fn|2}} He was succeeded as Wolf Lord by [[Berek Thunderfist]].{{Fn|4}}

