[[Image:Skorrvall.jpg|thumb|right|275px|Ancient Skorrvall{{Fn|1}}]]
'''Ancient Skorrvall''', also known as the '''Bitterblood''' and born '''Hunda Skorvall''' was a [[Contemptor Dreadnought]] of the [[Death Guard]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]]. He was amongst the first intake of [[Aspirant]]s taken from [[Barbarus]].{{citethis}}

Skorrvall was born on [[Barbarus]] and joined the army of the [[Primarch]] [[Mortarion]], as they waged [[Overlord Wars|war]] against the cruel [[Overlord (Xenos)|Overlord]] [[Xenos]], species that ruled his Homeworld. Skorvall became one of Mortarion's elite, known as the [[Death Guard]], and survived to see the last of the Overlords killed. Afterwards, Barbarus became part of the [[Imperium]] and Skorvall undertook the surgeries to become a [[Legionary]], in order to join Mortarion as he took the Death Guard into the [[Great Crusade]].{{Fn|2}}

He later served as [[Standard Bearer]] for the [[19th Chapter (Death Guard)|19th Chapter]] of the [[1st Great Company (Death Guard)|1st Great Company]] before he was mortally wounded in battle with the [[Eldar]] at [[Neverlight]], resulting in his internment within a [[Space Marine Dreadnought|Dreadnought]]. When the [[Horus Heresy|Heresy]] began, he joined his [[Primarch]] in siding with [[Horus]] and later served as part of [[Mortarion]]'s vanguard against the [[Loyalist]]s during the battle of [[Battle of Isstvan III]]. Ancient Skorrvall was badly damaged in the battle but was repaired in time to take part in the [[Drop Site Massacre]] on [[Isstvan V]].{{Fn|1}}

==Notes==
Skorrvall is alternatively written with two "r"{{Fn|1}} or with one as Skorvall{{Fn|2}}.

