Huntmaster (Deathmark).wikitext:
{{NecronsPortal}}
The '''Huntmaster''' is a [[Necron]] [[Deathmark]] of the [[Nihilakh Dynasty]], who serves [[Trazyn the Infinite]] as the game warden of the [[Tomb World]] [[Solemnace]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
His duties include collecting specimens for the [[Necron Overlord|Overlord]]'s [[Trazyn#Collections|collections]], as well as taking samples of exotic [[Xenos]]s species for study and preservation. Those taken by the Huntmaster have included [[Tyranids]], [[Kroot]]s and even his fellow [[Necrons]] as well.{{Fn|1}} 

Just prior to the [[Thirteenth Black Crusade]], the Hunstmaster aided [[Trazyn]] in convincing the [[Oruscar Dynasty]] to allow the [[Necron Overlord|Overlord]] to use their [[Celestial Orrery]]. This was done by threatening to unleash the [[Kardenath Dynasty]] [[Phaeron]] [[Akanabekh]] from a [[Tesseract Labyrinth]], as he sought to destroy all life by using the Orrery, and by having the Huntmaster aim a [[Synaptic Disintegrator]] at the head of the Conclave's leader, [[Dzukar]].{{Fn|1}}
==Wargear==
The Huntmaster wields a [[Synaptic Disintegrator]] and wears a [[Void Cape]].{{Fn|1}}

