Hurak (Death Watch).wikitext:
{{IronHandsPortal}}{{DeathwatchPortal}}
'''Hurak''' was an [[Iron Hands]] [[Death Watch]] [[Watch Sergeant|Sergeant]], who served in the [[Jericho Reach]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
In 805.[[M41]], he was among the [[Achilus Crusade]] and [[Death Watch]] forces, operating near the [[Jericho Reach]]'s [[Hadex Anomaly]], when the [[Space Hulk]] ''[[Crimson Harvest]]'' appeared there. Soon afterwards, [[Samech]]'s [[Dark Mechanicum]] warships attempted to reach it and Hurak and the other Imperial forces in the area sought to stop them. A series of running battles then occurred and in order to prevent Samech from gaining access to the Crimson Harvest, Hurrak led a [[Kill-Team]] aboard it. They then sacrificed themselves and plunged the Space Hulk into a dying star, in order to deny Samech its prize.{{Fn|1}}

