Hurlie Wrex.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Hurlie Wrex''' was an [[Arbites Captain]], part of the [[Arbites]] garrison force based in the city of [[Urbitane]] on the planet [[Sameter]] in early [[M41]].{{Fn|1}}

In '''241.[[M41]]''' she was among those Arbites assigned to investigate a series of ritual murders that had been committed in Urbitane. However, [[Eskeen Hansaard]], Urbitane's Minister of Security, believed that the killings indicated the presence of an [[Chaos Cult|heretical cult]] active on Sameter. Believing that the case was beyond the Arbites' purview, Hansaard sought assistance from the [[Inquisition]] (specifically [[Inquisitor]] [[Gregor Eisenhorn]], who was present in Urbitane following up on an unrelated case). When Hansaard met with Eisenhorn, Wrex went with him to present the Minister's evidence; on seeing the case file, Eisenhorn agreed to lead the investigation.{{Fn|1}}

