[[Image:Hyperion Ismene Themis IV.jpg|thumb|right|150px|[[Magos Dominus]] Hyperion Ismene Themis IV{{Fn|2}}]]
'''Hyperion Ismene Themis IV''' is a [[Magos Dominus]] from the [[Forgeworld]] [[Stygies VIII]] and is a [[Technoarchaeologist]] whose life's work is dedicated to the study of ancient weapons and wargear.{{Fn|1}}

==History==
He is currently searching for lost technology on the world [[Tarnagua]], where he is aided by his [[Skitarii]], as well as two [[Kastelan Robot]]s (named [[Axiom-88]] and [[Rhombus-4]]), led by the [[Cybernetica Datasmith|Datasmith]] [[Galenos]], which were given to him by his close peer the [[Tech Priest]] [[Callias Rhoda]] before he departed his Forgeworld. What Hyperion does not know, however, is that Callias is a [[Xenarite]] and that Galenos is secretly transmitting any data and information that the Magos discovers on Tarnagua back to the Tech Priest, who is the Datasmith's true master.{{Fn|1}}

