Hyrkan Averius.wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinesPortal}}
'''Hyrkan Averius''' was a former [[Chapter Master]] of the [[Hawk Lords]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
[[Orks]] were his most ancient foes and Averius sought to save his beloved [[Imperium]] by ensuring their complete annihilation. The [[Chapter Master]] launched countless raids against the never ending Greenskin tide that plagued the Imperium's borders and became hardened by the warfare. While he had endless hatred for Orks, though, Averius also had a baleful respect for the [[Xenos]].{{Fn|1}} When the Imperium launched the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]],{{Fn|2}} Averius was among its forces that fought{{Fn|1}} in the [[Gathrog Campaign]] against the Orks of the [[Green Kroosade]].{{Fn|3}} However the Chapter Master would later die in battle with the Xenos, during the Campaign.{{Fn|1}}
==Trivia==
