''Hyrkan Averius'' was created for the [[Dark Crusade Campaign]], by the '''Hobby Center''' staff of [[Games Workshop]]'s '''Festival at Bel Air''' store{{Fn|1}} in '''Bel Air, Maryland, USA'''.{{Fn|3}}

