Hyronimus Drake.wikitext:
{{InquisitionPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was an [[Inquisitor]] of the [[Imperium]] during the time of the [[Macharian Crusade]].{{Fn|1a}}

Accompanying [[Lord Solar]] [[Macharius (Character)|Macharius]] during the latter part of the Crusade, Drake saw one of his primary missions as monitoring Macharius himself for any signs of corruption.{{Fn|1a}} During the conflict on [[Karsk IV]], he aided Macharius in defeating a monstrous [[Lord of Change]] by using his expertise to close a [[Warp]] portal.{{Fn|2}} He continued to accompany Macharius on the Crusade, aiding him in the struggle for control of the [[Fist of Russ|Fist of Demetrius]] on [[Demetrius (World)|Demetrius]] and [[Procrastes]].{{Fn|3}}

During the war on [[Loki]] against the traitorous [[general]] [[Richter (Macharian Crusade)|Richter]], Drake, alongside [[Logan Grimnar]], slew the [[heretic]].{{Fn|1b}} However, he may have been also feeding the traitors intelligence in order to deliberately stall the war effort as part of his unknown ends.{{Fn|1c}}

Drake may or may not have been involved in the death of Macharius himself, as an [[Officio Assassinorum]] agent dubbed [[Anna]], masquerading as a [[Inquisitorial Storm Trooper]] in Drake's command, killed the famed general. However, the truth was buried shortly thereafter, as Drake was silenced by the same assassin.{{Fn|1c}}

