Ichos.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Ichos''' is an [[Astra Militarum]] [[General]], who is part of an [[Imperial Crusade]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
It was faltering, when Ichos received a message of hope from the [[Adeptus Custodes]] [[Shield Company]] [[Bayezara's Constellation]] on [[Mashena III]]. This turned the fate of the [[Crusade]] around and prevented its failure, which would have led to the ruin of the [[Sol System]].{{Fn|1}}

